{
    "title": "Beauty Camera & Selfie Camera",
    "description": "<b>Beauty Camera & Selfie Camera - Bling Cam</b> creates your own beauty and fashion with filters, style, stickers, makeup and photo editor.\r\n\r\n\u2728 <b>HD Beauty Sweet Selfie Camera:</b>\r\n* Real-time AR stickers and music filters\r\n* Beautify your skin, reshape your face, beauty filters and light makeup\r\n* Shoot video with stickers and filters\r\n* Provide flash, grid lines, countdown timer\r\n* Toggle front and rear beauty camera\r\n* Auto Exposure Focus and face recognition \r\n\r\n\u2728 <b>Real-time AR stickers:</b>\r\nAR mesh, change face, expression, background, gesture, music filter\r\n\r\n\u2728 <b>Beauty filter effects:</b>\r\nSelfie camera shoots attractive with filters in various styles. \r\n\r\n\u2728 <b>Powerful Photo Editor:</b>\r\n* Add beauty filters and stickers to photos\r\n* Resize, Crop, rotate, zoom\r\n* Add text\r\n* Draw line, Draw magic line\r\n* Backgroud eraser\r\n* Set picture quality, format, resolution and storage path\r\n* Show detailed information of the photos\r\n* Adjust photo: saturation, exposure, hue, etc.\r\n* DualExposure, Blur, Curve toning, white balance\r\n\r\n\u2728 <b>Photo Collage:</b>\r\n* Set layout, border, background\r\n* Adjust contrast, sharpness, saturation, exposure, hue, etc.\r\n* Add various stickers and filters to enhance effect\r\n* Choose ratio of the collage\r\n* Draw or add text to the photo collage\r\n\r\n <b>Beauty Selfie Camera - Bling Cam</b> helps you access quickly to every specific function. Powerful beauty selfie camera, photo editor and photo collage are all in one. No matter you are a shooting lover, retoucher or novice, we can always provide an enjoyable photo shooting and editing experience for you. We aim to provide <b> the best camera app </b> we can.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Beauty Camera &amp; Selfie Camera - Bling Cam</b> creates your own beauty and fashion with filters, style, stickers, makeup and photo editor.<br><br>\u2728 <b>HD Beauty Sweet Selfie Camera:</b><br>* Real-time AR stickers and music filters<br>* Beautify your skin, reshape your face, beauty filters and light makeup<br>* Shoot video with stickers and filters<br>* Provide flash, grid lines, countdown timer<br>* Toggle front and rear beauty camera<br>* Auto Exposure Focus and face recognition <br><br>\u2728 <b>Real-time AR stickers:</b><br>AR mesh, change face, expression, background, gesture, music filter<br><br>\u2728 <b>Beauty filter effects:</b><br>Selfie camera shoots attractive with filters in various styles. <br><br>\u2728 <b>Powerful Photo Editor:</b><br>* Add beauty filters and stickers to photos<br>* Resize, Crop, rotate, zoom<br>* Add text<br>* Draw line, Draw magic line<br>* Backgroud eraser<br>* Set picture quality, format, resolution and storage path<br>* Show detailed information of the photos<br>* Adjust photo: saturation, exposure, hue, etc.<br>* DualExposure, Blur, Curve toning, white balance<br><br>\u2728 <b>Photo Collage:</b><br>* Set layout, border, background<br>* Adjust contrast, sharpness, saturation, exposure, hue, etc.<br>* Add various stickers and filters to enhance effect<br>* Choose ratio of the collage<br>* Draw or add text to the photo collage<br><br> <b>Beauty Selfie Camera - Bling Cam</b> helps you access quickly to every specific function. Powerful beauty selfie camera, photo editor and photo collage are all in one. No matter you are a shooting lover, retoucher or novice, we can always provide an enjoyable photo shooting and editing experience for you. We aim to provide <b> the best camera app </b> we can.",
